  <ferc:MannerAndExtentOfCorporateControl id="f-35" contextRef="c-1">Bison Pipeline LLC (the Company), a Delaware limited liability company formed on May 27, 2008. The Company is a wholly owned direct subsidiary of TC PipeLines, LP. TransCanada Northern Border Inc. is the operator of the Company's pipeline. Both TC PipeLines, LP and TransCanada Northern Border Inc., are subsidiaries of TC Energy.</ferc:MannerAndExtentOfCorporateControl>
